    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Texas</strong> is a tactical adventure set in the Wild West, where every duel is settled on the chessboard. Travel from dusty saloons to desert outposts, challenging bandits, bosses, and townsfolk to strategic battles in a handcrafted open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each town hides its own Chess Hall, run by a tough opponent with a unique puzzle theme. Outthink, outplay, and outlast them to earn your place in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, talk, challenge, and conquer\u2014this ain't just chess, it's <i>Chess Texas</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild West Adventure</strong> \u2013 Roam across towns, camps, and routes in a stylized cowboy setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/bd2bfa8da4abdd66731cdb787a5de2a9.avif?t=1754027215\" width=800 height=351 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face off in themed chess puzzles against powerful Chess Hall leaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/2f1f0bf3c8b7bc5c8e96d156f8e74a19.avif?t=1754027215\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and Characters</strong> \u2013 Meet quirky NPCs, uncover secrets, and piece together the legends of Chess Texas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/42340371db600884dd259ed3b00e127e.avif?t=1754027215\" width=800 height=343 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Variety</strong> \u2013 From classic matches to Fischer Random and bait-focused AIs, each match tests a different skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/bd6dcbb968731c7097ccbe76b7158c39.avif?t=1754027215\" width=800 height=452 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover tools, clues, and advantages in the overworld that help during chess battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/e5fe4c2797aa822e9cb49ce5cfc45780.avif?t=1754027215\" width=518 height=212 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddle up and bring your brain. It's time to take the West, one board at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Texas</strong> is a tactical adventure set in the Wild West, where every duel is settled on the chessboard. Travel from dusty saloons to desert outposts, challenging bandits, bosses, and townsfolk to strategic battles in a handcrafted open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each town hides its own Chess Hall, run by a tough opponent with a unique puzzle theme. Outthink, outplay, and outlast them to earn your place in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, talk, challenge, and conquer\u2014this ain't just chess, it's <i>Chess Texas</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild West Adventure</strong> \u2013 Roam across towns, camps, and routes in a stylized cowboy setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/bd2bfa8da4abdd66731cdb787a5de2a9.avif?t=1754027215\" width=800 height=351 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face off in themed chess puzzles against powerful Chess Hall leaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/2f1f0bf3c8b7bc5c8e96d156f8e74a19.avif?t=1754027215\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and Characters</strong> \u2013 Meet quirky NPCs, uncover secrets, and piece together the legends of Chess Texas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/42340371db600884dd259ed3b00e127e.avif?t=1754027215\" width=800 height=343 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Variety</strong> \u2013 From classic matches to Fischer Random and bait-focused AIs, each match tests a different skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/bd6dcbb968731c7097ccbe76b7158c39.avif?t=1754027215\" width=800 height=452 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover tools, clues, and advantages in the overworld that help during chess battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/e5fe4c2797aa822e9cb49ce5cfc45780.avif?t=1754027215\" width=518 height=212 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddle up and bring your brain. It's time to take the West, one board at a time.</p>",
